[en.FOCUS_C11_BORDER_RECRUIT]
Jungle Recruitment

[en.FOCUS_C11_BORDER_RECRUIT_desc]
Although the Changelings are a superior race, they are not adept at fighting in the jungle — that is the domain of the zebras. Therefore, we need to recruit some zebras, or at least some changelings borned in the jungle, to fight and die in the frontline, to lower the casualties of our noble forces.

[zh.FOCUS_C11_BORDER_RECRUIT]
丛林募兵

[zh.FOCUS_C11_BORDER_RECRUIT_desc]
虽然幻形灵是上等种族，但是他们并不擅长在丛林中作战——那是斑马们更擅长的事情。因此，我们需要在丛林中招募一些斑马，或者至少是一些在丛林中出生的幻形灵，他们将会代替我们高贵的部队流血牺牲。

